IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS
Orb animation (state driven, real signals only)
Keep the construction: a circular container with overflow hidden, 3 to 4 large soft blobs over a base fill, animated with transform and opacity only (translate, rotate, scale), on compositor layers. No canvas, video, images, particles, sparkles, glows or extra rings.
