Thinking: slate family at lower saturation. A slow steady swirl (one full rotation of the blob layers about every 6s) and a soft brightness pulse (opacity only, about 1.6s), so it clearly reads as "working".
Speaking: violet family. A flowing swirl with the orb scale following the real output level when the audio source exposes it (decoded Gemini TTS audio through an analyser). The browser voice exposes no level, so use a steady speaking rhythm at fixed intensity (a state animation, not a fake level).
